  "body": "The spacious lounge, with its high ceilings and sweeping sea views across Whangaparaoa Bay, is the standout. The elevated kitchen and dining area adds another dimension to the living space, with glimpses of the sea through the windows. Outside, the wraparound decking offers a covered spot for outdoor dining or simply sitting back and taking in the coastal outlook.\r\nSet in a sought-after coastal location, this property is being sold 'As Is, Where Is'. With much of the interior already refreshed, it's an opportunity for builders, renovators or any buyer with the vision and the right people on hand to take on the exterior work. \r\nInside, much of the home has already been refreshed, with new GIB wall linings, plastering and painting all professionally completed. The bathrooms have also been renovated.\r\nThe layout spans two levels, with a substantial multipurpose area downstairs that has its own external access, a bathroom, rumpus and an additional room for a potential kitchenette. \r\nIf you've been looking for a coastal renovation project, come and see the outlook for yourself. Bring your builder, take a good look at the work involved and carry out your own due diligence.\r\nStanmore Bay Beach is a short stroll away, with New World, Stanmore Bay Shopping Centre and the Penlink project all close by.\r\nGet in touch anytime to arrange a private viewing at a time that suits you.\r\nYou can find the property documents here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/PVU2",
